              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Every answer type as the answerer meets it, on the issue and in the inbox. Each card keeps Add a note, Ask back and Reassign, so nobody is forced into a false answer. Four cards show a check that holds Send back: Other with its text, too few picks, a fact without its correction, and Request changes without a note.",
